        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Bread and Wine: An Erotic Tale of New York, Bread & Wine\n- People: Samuel R. Delany, Mia Wolff\n- Topics: graphic novels, science fiction, memoir, criticism, essays on sexuality and society\n\nFacts:\n- In 1999, Bread and Wine: An Erotic Tale of New York was published as an American graphic novel.\n- Bread and Wine: An Erotic Tale of New York is also stylized as Bread & Wine.\n- Samuel R. Delany wrote Bread and Wine: An Erotic Tale of New York.\n- Mia Wolff created the art for Bread and Wine: An Erotic Tale of New York.\n- Samuel R. Delany's work includes fiction, especially science fiction, memoir, criticism, and essays on sexuality and society.",
